    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6805" root="جيد" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيِدَ</span></b> , (Lh, L,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَادَ</span>, of the same class
as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعِبَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَجَادُ</span>, (Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيَدٌ</span>, (Lh, S,
A, L, Msb, K,) <i>He had a long neck:</i> (A, Msb,
K:) or <i>a long and beautiful neck:</i> (S, L:) or <i>a
slender and long neck.</i> (L, K.)

